WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.083
Everybody can do something! What can they do?

2
00:00:05.533 --> 00:00:11.199
This is Maria. She can dance! She dances every weekend.

3
00:00:11.649 --> 00:00:13.320
But she can't sing.

4
00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:17.939
This is Leo. Can he cook?

5
00:00:18.389 --> 00:00:22.894
Yes, I can! I'm a chef. I can cook Italian and Japanese food.

6
00:00:25.144 --> 00:00:28.487
This is baby Theo. He's one year old.

7
00:00:28.937 --> 00:00:34.371
He can't speak, and he can't walk. But he can sleep all day!

8
00:00:36.621 --> 00:00:40.057
This is Ana. She can swim very well.

9
00:00:40.507 --> 00:00:43.758
She swims in the sea every morning.

10
00:00:46.008 --> 00:00:50.048
Hi, I'm Paulo. I can play the guitar, and I can sing too.

11
00:00:50.498 --> 00:00:51.892
But I can't dance!

12
00:00:54.142 --> 00:00:56.278
And you? What can you do?

